<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03 · 技术总览：五层架构与选型</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            技术选型刻意保守：主要风险不在工程，而在判断标准本身，因此把复杂度留给领域问题。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 72, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>输入层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>文本 / PDF / 图片 / docx 切题；手写作答识别后回填</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 200, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>multimodal.py · 分页渲染</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 72, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>生产层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三段流水线 + 四档老师路由（质量与成本权衡）</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 200, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>solver.py · 分题型提示词</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>契约层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C8DCF7', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>每步含标准过程、详细过程、知识点、五维难度</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 200, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9EC1F0', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>全系统唯一中间产物</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 72, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>消费层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>难度 · 批改 · 教学 · 仿题 · 组卷 · 规划 · 智能体</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 200, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>共享同一份步骤数据</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 72, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>5</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>沉淀层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>题库 · 题单 · 套路掌握 · 巩固日历 · 整卷报告</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 200, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>SQLite · 按用户隔离</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>选型</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>FastAPI + SQLite + 原生 HTML/JS；公式与几何库全部本地化，不依赖外部服务。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>规模</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>后端约 25,000 行，前端 23 个页面，803 个 Python 测试方法与 28 个前端用例。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>09 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
